From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] deckcraft: zip 9 (RUSTSEC-2026-0545, -0548)

zip 3.0.0 to 9 (owner decision 2026-11-22): the workspace requirement and the call sites of the API changes we
meet: ZipFile::name and ZipArchive::file_names now return ZipResult<Cow<str>>, ZipFile::data_start returns
Option<u64>. Production: opc.rs maps a name error to PptxError::NotPptx. Tests: .unwrap() / .flatten().
Cargo.lock is patch 0921.
---
